_🗄️ Data Integrity & Integration_ | _🟠 Major_ | _⚡ Quick win_

**Report the created client ID when contact creation fails.**

`quickfile_client_create` performs two writes. If the contact POST fails, the client record already exists, but the handler returns only an error. A retry then creates a duplicate client.

Catch the contact failure and return the created `clientId` with a warning.





<details>
<summary>🐛 Proposed fix to preserve the created client ID</summary>

```diff
         let contactId: number | undefined;
+        let contactError: string | undefined;
         if (hasContactInput(args)) {
-          const contact = await client.request<EntityResponse>(
-            `/clients/${created.id}/contacts`,
-            { method: "POST", body: contactBody(args) },
-          );
-          contactId = contact.id;
+          try {
+            const contact = await client.request<EntityResponse>(
+              `/clients/${created.id}/contacts`,
+              { method: "POST", body: contactBody(args) },
+            );
+            contactId = contact.id;
+          } catch (error) {
+            contactError = `Client ${created.id} was created, but the contact was not: ${
+              error instanceof Error ? error.message : String(error)
+            }`;
+          }
         }
-        return successResult({ success: true, clientId: created.id, contactId });
+        return successResult({
+          success: true,
+          clientId: created.id,
+          contactId,
+          ...(contactError ? { warning: contactError } : {}),
+        });
```
</details>

<!-- suggestion_start -->

<details>
<summary>📝 Committable suggestion</summary>

> ‼️ **IMPORTANT**
> Carefully review the code before committing. Ensure that it accurately replaces the highlighted code, contains no missing lines, and has no issues with indentation. Thoroughly test & benchmark the code to ensure it meets the requirements.

```suggestion
        const created = await client.request<EntityResponse>("/clients", {
          method: "POST",
          body: clientBody(args, true),
        });
        let contactId: number | undefined;
        let contactError: string | undefined;
        if (hasContactInput(args)) {
          try {
            const contact = await client.request<EntityResponse>(
              `/clients/${created.id}/contacts`,
              { method: "POST", body: contactBody(args) },
            );
            contactId = contact.id;
          } catch (error) {
            contactError = `Client ${created.id} was created, but the contact was not: ${
              error instanceof Error ? error.message : String(error)
            }`;
          }
        }
        return successResult({
          success: true,
          clientId: created.id,
          contactId,
          ...(contactError ? { warning: contactError } : {}),
        });
```

</details>

